! option
  rektangel            Rektangel
  rektangel:caps_hyper Caps Lock is Hyper on Mod3, Shift+Caps Lock is Caps Lock
  rektangel:caps_hyper_only Caps Lock is always Hyper on Mod3, no Caps Lock
  rektangel:caps_hyper_both_shifts Caps Lock is always Hyper on Mod3, both Shift keys together are Caps Lock
